Work done
  Wrote apps/www-reading-advantage/src/lib/tutor-commission.ts with the exact API of spec 5.2:
  - constants CLASS_PRICE_DEFAULT = 3000, TAX_RATE = 0.03, LEG_STUDENTS_DEFAULT = 3;
  - types NetworkInput, LegResult, NetworkResult;
  - commissionRate(volume): 0 at V <= 0; 0.4 + V/200000 below 20000; else
    (0.5 * (1 - 0.3 ** (1 + ln(V/20000)/ln(5)))) / 0.7;
  - BigInt satang rule of D-3: gvSatang = round(baht * 100), rateUnits = round(rate * 1e9),
    flatSatang = rateUnits * gvSatang / 1e9 truncated, tax = payoutSatang * 3 / 100 truncated;
  - one level of legs (D-1, D-4): each leg payout is rate(legVolume) * legVolume, and the tutor
    payout is max(0, gross - sum of the leg payouts); leg satang are kept exact and summed,
    never round-tripped through a baht Number;
  - payoutAfterDeduction(gross, paidBelow) with the zero floor;
  - explainVariant returning "zero" | "ownOnly" | "withDownline";
  - resizeLegs keeping entries, appending LEG_STUDENTS_DEFAULT, and dropping the rest;
  - NETWORK_PRESETS with the three inputs of D-2 at price 3000;
  - negative and non-finite inputs clamp to 0; counts become whole numbers of 0 or more;
  - JSDoc on every export.

